    "description": {
      "value": "You unleash a small blast of potential that destroys one of a creature's possible futures, leaving them reeling. You deal 2d4 mental damage to the creature, and it must attempt a Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half the mental damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is flat-footed until the start of its turn.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage, becomes stunned 1, and is flat-footed until the start of your next turn."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 3d4."
    },
